  data: {
    LLM: '1. Before play: announce Ronda (pair) = 1 pt or Tringa (triplet) = 5 pts. Best wins all. 2. Play one card. If matches table card: capture pair + all higher in ascending sequence. If no match: trail. 3. Este/caida: capture last played = 1 pt. Third same rank = 5; fourth = 10. 4. Mesa: clear table = 1 pt.',
    Player: '1. Before play: announce Ronda (pair) = 1 pt or Tringa (triplet) = 5 pts. Best wins all. 2. Play one card. If matches table card: capture pair + all higher in ascending sequence. If no match: trail. 3. Este/caida: capture last played = 1 pt. Third same rank = 5; fourth = 10. 4. Mesa: clear table = 1 pt.',
